## Manual Guide: Adding a New Webpage to the Platform

The platform now uses a **configuration-based system**. Simply add your page to the config file and the buttons will be automatically generated with topic filtering. The "Back to Index" button is also automatically injected by a shared script.

Master: [src/pagesConfig.js](cci:7://file:///Users/Hugo/Desktop/chemleungmcq-platform-gamified/f4-chem-learning-resources/src/pagesConfig.js:0:0-0:0)

ICON prompt: Flat vector icon of [INSERT TOPIC], simple minimalist shape design, clean geometric lines, single isolated object centered, modern UI icon aesthetic, solid flat colors, pure white background, no text, no labels, no gradient, 1:1 aspect ratio. Scientifically, theoretically correct. INSERT TOPIC

ICON Name: ___-thumb.png


### 1. Create or Place Your HTML File
- Put your webpage file in the project root (e.g., `your-page.html`)
- Ensure it has a proper HTML structure with `<!DOCTYPE html>`
- Add this line at the very top of your `<body>` tag:
  ```html
  <script src="/common.js"></script>
  ```
  This automatically injects the "Back to Index" button with consistent styling.

### 2. Add to Vite Build Configuration
Edit [vite.config.js](cci:7://file:///Users/Hugo/Desktop/chemleungmcq-platform-gamified/f4-chem-learning-resources/vite.config.js:0:0-0:0) and add your page to the `input` object under `build.rollupOptions.input`:

```javascript
input: {
  index: 'index.html',
  'chemical-bonding': 'chemical-bonding.html',
  'neutralization-exothermic': 'neutralization-exothermic.html',
  'salt-page': 'salt-page.html',
  'titration': 'titration.html',
  'hotGuidingSaltPrepReactingMass': 'HOT_guiding_saltprep_reactingmass.html',
  'your-page': 'your-page.html',  // ← Add this line
},
```

### 3. Add Page to Configuration File
Edit [src/pagesConfig.js](cci:7://file:///Users/Hugo/Desktop/chemleungmcq-platform-gamified/f4-chem-learning-resources/src/pagesConfig.js:0:0-0:0) and add your page entry to the `PAGES_CONFIG` array:

```javascript
{
  file: 'your-page.html',
  level: 'F4',  // 'F3' | 'F4' | 'F5'
  title: 'Your Page Title',
  subtitle: 'Brief description shown below title',
  topic: 'your-topic',  // e.g., 'bonding', 'acids-bases', 'salts', 'titration', 'hot'
},
```

If your topic is new, also add it to `TOPIC_LABELS`:

```javascript
export const TOPIC_LABELS = {
  bonding: 'Bonding',
  'acids-bases': 'Acids & Bases',
  salts: 'Salts',
  titration: 'Titration',
  hot: 'HOT Questions',
  'your-topic': 'Your Topic Label',  // ← Add this
};
```

