- [ ] HTML file in project root
- [ ] `<script src="/common.js"></script>` added at top of `<body>`
- [ ] Added to [vite.config.js](cci:7://file:///Users/Hugo/Desktop/chemleungmcq-platform-gamified/f4-chem-learning-resources/vite.config.js:0:0-0:0) input
- [ ] Page entry added to [src/pagesConfig.js](cci:7://file:///Users/Hugo/Desktop/chemleungmcq-platform-gamified/f4-chem-learning-resources/src/pagesConfig.js:0:0-0:0)
- [ ] Topic label added to `TOPIC_LABELS` (if new topic)
- [ ] Test locally with `npm run dev`
- [ ] Build and deploy with `npm run build` and `npx vercel --prod`.